#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_invert.rst:5
msgid "Invert the selection"
msgstr "反向选择"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_invert.rst:7
msgid ""
"Some times is easier to select the `parts`_ from the `workspace`_ which are "
"not interested for the desired action than the `parts`_ which should be "
"selected. For this reason, QElectroTech provides the option to invert the "
"selection."
msgstr ""
"有时，选择 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中不希望执行目标操作的 `部件 <parts_>`_ 比选择应选中的 `部件 <parts_>`_ "
"更容易。因此，QElectroTech 提供了反向选择功能。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_invert.rst:11
msgid ""
"Inverting the selection can be done from `Menu bar`_ or using the "
"corresponding keyboard shortcut."
msgstr "可以通过 `菜单栏 <Menu bar_>`_ 或相应的快捷键反向选择。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_invert.rst:14
msgid "Invert selection from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏反向选择"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_invert.rst:16
#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_invert.rst:29
msgid ""
"`Select the part/s`_ from the opened `element`_ which are not interested for"
" the desired action."
msgstr "在已打开 `元件 <element_>`_ 中 `Select the part/s`_ ，选中不希望执行目标操作的部件。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_invert.rst:17
msgid "Select **Edit > Invert selection** to invert the selection."
msgstr "选择 **编辑 > 反向选择** 以反向选择。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_invert.rst:22
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Edit menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 编辑菜单"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_invert.rst:25
msgid "Invert selection using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键反向选择"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_invert.rst:27
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech 允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_invert.rst:30
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + i`` to invert the selection."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + i`` 反向选择。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_invert.rst:34
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcut, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "有关 QElectroTech 键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参阅 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
